{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47159","headline":"武昌怀古 · 栖一","name":"武昌怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"战国城池尽悄然，昔人遗迹遍山川。\n笙歌罢吹几多日，台榭荒凉七百年。\n蝉响夕阳风满树，雁横秋岛雨漫天。\n堪嗟世事如流水，空见芦花一钓船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"栖一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47159.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47159","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}